{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13000","headline":"早发龙沮馆舟中寄东海徐司仓郑司户 · 独孤及","name":"早发龙沮馆舟中寄东海徐司仓郑司户","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沙禽相呼曙色分，渔浦鸣桹十里闻。\n正当秋风渡楚水，况值远道伤离羣。\n津头却望後湖岸，别处已隔东山云。\n停舻目送北归翼，惜无瑶华持寄君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}